flowchart LR
    wsi[Input<br/>Raw WSIs]
    env[Input<br/>.env + artifact settings]
    p1[Phase 1<br/>1_artifact_detection.py<br/>Detect artifacts on slides]
    geojson[Output<br/>Artifact GeoJSON files]
    sqlite[Output<br/>Artifact SQLite tracking]
    no_manifest[[master_manifest.sqlite<br/>No interaction in Phase 1]]

    wsi --> p1
    env --> p1
    p1 --> geojson
    p1 --> sqlite
    p1 -. no read / no write .-> no_manifest
